      },
      {
        "name": "Explanation",
        "score": 8,
        "rationale": "The reply names the real failure mode: a non-zero `$(...)` capture under `set -euo pipefail` kills the runner with no FAIL or Results line and skips later tests. It lists only `cmp` and `grep` as causes, though, and mentions the `assert_slug` crash path only among the changes."
      }
    ],
    "overall": 8.3
